#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:1
#: 4283f2a9521b4e319f842c1e45050ff4
msgid "能量基线平移：去掉巨大的常数能量"
msgstr "Energy baseline shift: Remove a Large Constant Energy"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:3
#: f7d3ae7ebfda4d4c9f77d0eb126706f3
msgid ""
"能量基线平移最常见的用途，是在训练前去掉 DFT 总能量中的巨大常数项。某些 ABACUS、CP2K 数据按原子归一后仍可能达到数千甚至数万 "
"eV，而模型真正需要学习的是小得多的结构间能量差。直接用 `float32` "
"训练时，大数会占用有效位数；先把基线移到零附近，可以给这些小能量差留下更多数值精度。"
msgstr ""
"The most common purpose of energy baseline shifting is to remove a large "
"constant term from DFT total energies before training. Some ABACUS and "
"CP2K datasets can still reach thousands or even tens of thousands of eV "
"per atom, while the model needs to learn much smaller energy differences "
"between structures. With `float32` training, the large values consume "
"significant digits; shifting the baseline close to zero preserves more "
"numerical precision for those small differences."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:5
#: 4e4107c722d64975a15dae77b547a186
msgid ""
"在 `energy` 图上，这类问题通常表现为 DFT 能量和 NEP "
"预测**整体错开**，但点云的相对形状仍然一致。平移只处理能量零点，不会让模型本身变准；如果散点很散、弯曲，或者只有少数结构偏离，应先检查模型和数据。"
msgstr ""
"In the `energy` plot, this usually appears as a **systematic offset** "
"between DFT energies and NEP predictions while the relative shape of the "
"point cloud remains the same. Shifting only changes the energy zero; it "
"does not improve the model. If the points are scattered, curved, or only "
"a few structures are off, inspect the model and data first."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:7
#: e2fae6061ad7475982989fa33fc4ce04
msgid "1. 先看能量图"
msgstr "1. Inspect the energy plot first"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:9
#: 2c4e98ee957c4f8cb3fba14e3c9e5ed4
msgid "在 `NEP 数据集查看` 中打开带 DFT 能量的数据和对应的 NEP 模型，然后看 `energy` 散点图。"
msgstr ""
"Open the dataset containing DFT energies and its corresponding NEP model "
"in `NEP Dataset Display`, then inspect the `energy` scatter plot."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:11
#: eec119fb56b84078ae9da4fcfbf89c7c
msgid "能量图和能量基线平移按钮"
msgstr "Energy plot and energy baseline shift button"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:11
#: eec119fb56b84078ae9da4fcfbf89c7c
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/tutorials/energy_baseline_shift_entry.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/tutorials/energy_baseline_shift_entry.png"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:16
#: f98f63e34e3246e0afb4e302ba8be99c
msgid "确认是巨大的整体基线后，点击工具栏中的 `能量基线平移`。"
msgstr ""
"After confirming a large overall baseline, click `Energy baseline shift` "
"in the toolbar."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:18
#: 2959df5d2faa4262bd2b3ddb498ee1e9
msgid ""
"平移会修改当前数据集里的 `energy`。程序会把第一次平移前的值记在 "
"`energy_original`，但不会自动撤销后续平移。操作前仍建议先导出一份原始数据。"
msgstr ""
"The shift changes `energy` in the current dataset. NepTrainKit records "
"the value before the first shift as `energy_original`, but it does not "
"automatically undo later shifts. Export a copy of the original data "
"first."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:20
#: d48fb318b7c34d09901019cf97a88651
msgid "2. 按这个例子设置"
msgstr "2. Use these settings"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:22
#: 27a4bc9f1a1549dfa28d29d812951b1e
msgid "能量基线平移设置窗口"
msgstr "Energy baseline shift settings"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:22
#: 27a4bc9f1a1549dfa28d29d812951b1e
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_shift_dialog.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_shift_dialog.png"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:27
#: 4ea05ce6a75b43ccb137a27dcf1e7418
msgid "第一次使用时这样设置即可："
msgstr "For the first run, use the following settings:"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:29
#: 65b3f7dbfdbe40509568703605cf29ff
msgid "`Use existing preset` 保持空白。"
msgstr "Leave `Use existing preset` empty."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:30
#: 155978e2a72243c99a890d66cb3d8a46
msgid "如果数据来自同一软件、同一套计算设置，把分组规则填写为 `.*`，让所有 `Config_type` 共用一套基线。"
msgstr ""
"If the data come from the same software and computational settings, enter"
" `.*` so all `Config_type` values share one baseline."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:31
#: aa3d5ef7ca69442185b1bba4ab37ba0f
#
msgid "`对齐模式` 选择 `DFT 到 NEP`。它根据当前 NEP 预测，拟合每种元素的能量基线，并平移数据集中的 DFT 能量。"
msgstr "Set `Alignment mode` to `DFT to NEP`. It uses the current NEP predictions to fit a baseline for each element and shifts the dataset's DFT energies."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:32
#: 9e88f57ac2eb449d8d42a491b5566f4b
msgid "`最大代数`、`种群大小` 和 `收敛容差` 先保留默认值。"
msgstr "Keep the defaults for `Max generations`, `Population size`, and `Convergence tolerance`."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:33
#: 0cd2bea352bf4b44b06c2b5ec1537160
msgid "点击 `OK`，等待能量图重新绘制。"
msgstr "Click `OK` and wait for the energy plot to redraw."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:35
#: f0d75be2c4cc4b548f84d3c639ac921d
msgid ""
"不要仅因为数据里有多个 `Config_type` "
"就逐组拟合。即使来自同一软件，每组单独拟合也可能把求解过程中的微小偏差吸收到基线里；同一计算来源使用 `.*` 更稳妥。"
msgstr ""
"Do not fit each group separately just because the dataset contains "
"multiple `Config_type` values. Even for the same software, separate fits "
"can absorb small solver differences into the baselines; using `.*` for "
"one calculation source is more robust."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:37
#: f1f255c85cb34a429138fb3a52d1e4e4
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 分组主要用于区分不同能量基线来源。只有数据混合了不同软件时才拆组，例如 "
"`abacus.*;cp2k.*`，多条规则用英文分号 `;` 分隔。不同泛函、赝势或计算精度带来的差异不只影响能量零点，不要靠平移强行混合。"
msgstr ""
"`Config_type` grouping is mainly for distinguishing different energy-"
"baseline sources. Split groups only when the dataset mixes different "
"software, for example `abacus.*;cp2k.*`; separate rules with semicolons. "
"Differences in functionals, pseudopotentials, or numerical settings "
"affect more than the energy zero, so do not force such data together with"
" a shift."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:39
#: 3a59499ddace46e39f42f6221d79aa6e
msgid "3. 看结果是否正确"
msgstr "3. Check the result"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:41
#: 3c8e68e9675c48e0ad70f7baa71c93f8
msgid "平移后回到 `energy` 图："
msgstr "Return to the `energy` plot after the shift:"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:43
#: a40a2274d8b64985b4bac19983aed5f4
msgid "消除整体能量偏移后的散点图"
msgstr "Scatter plot after removing the systematic energy offset"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:43
#: a40a2274d8b64985b4bac19983aed5f4
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/tutorials/energy_baseline_shift_result.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/tutorials/energy_baseline_shift_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:48
#: 99b531095718404885ec6ebd8c7447d6
msgid "巨大的绝对能量基线被去掉，能量回到更适合训练的数值范围；"
msgstr ""
"The large absolute-energy baseline is removed, bringing energies into a "
"numerical range better suited to training."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:49
#: 041433d32246480480a78bfe5dabaebd
msgid "点云整体靠近对角线，说明主要差异确实来自能量零点；"
msgstr ""
"The point cloud moves close to the diagonal, indicating that the main "
"difference came from the energy zero."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:50
#: 6e5f9229d4ed4dd88bcef5d1e3c02230
msgid "点云的相对顺序和形状应该基本保留；"
msgstr ""
"The relative ordering and shape of the point cloud should remain largely "
"unchanged."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:51
#: 631382d28e844c0883d7fd97d73fc3ce
msgid "如果仍明显散开，不要继续反复平移，转去检查异常结构、分组规则和模型误差。"
msgstr ""
"If the points remain widely scattered, do not repeat the shift. Check "
"abnormal structures, grouping rules, and model error instead."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:53
#: a0d07e66e31f41df8d35c89996ef1bd5
msgid "能量基线不是给所有结构减去同一个常数。程序会根据结构中的元素个数，减去对应的逐元素基线。因此，包含不同元素或不同原子数的结构也可以放在同一数据集中处理。"
msgstr ""
"An energy baseline is not one constant subtracted from every structure. "
"NepTrainKit subtracts element-specific baselines according to the element"
" counts, so structures with different elements or atom counts can be "
"handled in one dataset."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:55
#: 4ae9373fd0444a40b29394696929e833
#
msgid ""
"确认结果后，用 `保存` 导出新文件，不要覆盖原始训练集。以后需要处理同一类数据时，可以勾选 `将基线保存为预设` "
"保存本次基线；预设只适用于元素和 `Config_type` 分组方式相符的数据。"
msgstr "After checking the result, use `Save` to export a new file without overwriting the original training set. For the same kind of data in the future, select `Save baseline as preset`; a preset applies only when the elements and `Config_type` grouping match."

#~ msgid "`Max generations`、`Population size` 和 `Convergence tolerance` 先保留默认值。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Keep the default values for `Max "
#~ "generations`, `Population size`, and "
#~ "`Convergence tolerance`."
